Like, it's, it's sort of like that.

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:20.420
That, that's got the slipperiness of Mario, but it doesn't feel as good.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:27.220
And like, so yeah, they're, they were definitely trying to make this like a Prince of Persia momentum based game.

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.300
Uh, but it doesn't really, doesn't really hit.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:35.340
Like you said, that whole, that whole, like, walk to run just feels off.

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:41.580
Like, it's like maybe a second and a half of holding down a directional button before you get to that run.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:44.640
And that makes some jumping fickle.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:52.120
So I feel like if they did execute better on this movement thing, maybe it would be a better game.

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:59.300
Um, but I don't, I don't really know if there's all that much here anyway.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:09.640
